  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Where an error belongs differs",
      "items": [
        "The session error callback receives only transport errors that belong to that session. A handshake failure has no session to call yet, and a socket-level or node-level error cannot be pinned to one session, so both go to runtime observation.",
        "An application handler's exception goes to the handler exception path. There is no surface that runs a receive loop directly."
      ]
    }
